 * - Heartbeat Sensor (HW-827)  -> GPIO34 (ADC)
 * - DS18B20 Temperature Sensor  -> GPIO4 (OneWire)
 * - MPU6050 I2C SDA            -> GPIO21
 * - MPU6050 I2C SCL            -> GPIO22
 */

